</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>If the application includes the bluetooth_feature_use_accurate_api_address_types component, <computeroutput>target_address_type</computeroutput> uses enum <ref refid="group__sl__bt__gap_1gac8d5431d3062e47c5d51b9fb9f36c104" kindref="member">sl_bt_gap_address_type_t</ref> values:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_gap_public_address (0x0):</bold> Public device address</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_gap_static_address (0x1):</bold> Static device address</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_gap_random_resolvable_address (0x2):</bold> Resolvable private random address</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_gap_random_nonresolvable_address (0x3):</bold> Non-resolvable private random address</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_gap_public_address_resolved_from_rpa (0x4):</bold> Public identity address resolved from a resolvable private address (RPA)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_gap_static_address_resolved_from_rpa (0x5):</bold> Static identity address resolved from a resolvable private address (RPA) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
